{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/mendelian-inheritance/","source":"students/subjects/biology/genetics/mendelian-inheritance.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mendelian Inheritance | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/genetics/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Genetics &amp; Evolution</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Mendelian Inheritance</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding the basic principles of heredity</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand Mendel's laws of inheritance</li>\n                        <li>• Explain chromosomal basis of inheritance</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze patterns of dominant and recessive traits</li>\n                        <li>• Apply genetic crosses to predict offspring traits</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Mendelian Genetics Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Mendel's Experiments</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Understanding pea plant studies and laws of inheritance</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Genetic Crosses</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Working with Punnett squares and inheritance patterns</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Mendel's Laws</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Law of Segregation:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Allele pairs separate</li>\n                                    <li>- Random distribution to gametes</li>\n                                    <li>- Pure breeding examples</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Law of Independent Assortment:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Different traits inherit separately</li>\n                                    <li>- Random combinations</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Experimental evidence:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Pea plant characteristics</li>\n                                    <li>- Breeding patterns</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Chromosomes and Inheritance</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Chromosome structure:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- DNA packaging</li>\n                                    <li>- Gene locations</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Meiosis connection:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Chromosome separation</li>\n                                    <li>- Gamete formation</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Chromosomal basis:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Gene pairs</li>\n                                    <li>- Allele segregation</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Dominance Patterns</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Complete dominance:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Dominant alleles</li>\n                                    <li>- Recessive alleles</li>\n                                    <li>- Phenotype expression</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Genotype vs Phenotype:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Homozygous</li>\n                                    <li>- Heterozygous</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Common examples:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Human traits</li>\n                                    <li>- Plant characteristics</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Genetic Crosses</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Punnett squares:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Setting up crosses</li>\n                                    <li>- Predicting outcomes</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Types of crosses:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Monohybrid cross</li>\n                                    <li>- Dihybrid cross</li>\n                                    <li>- Test cross</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Probability rules:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Product rule</li>\n                                    <li>- Sum rule</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Genetic Crosses</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Punnett square practice</li>\n                                <li>• Probability calculations</li>\n                                <li>• Pedigree analysis</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Trait Studies</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Human trait surveys</li>\n                                <li>• Plant cross observations</li>\n                                <li>• Pattern recognition</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Explain Mendel's Law of Segregation using an example.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include gamete formation and possible offspring combinations.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Solve a dihybrid cross problem.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Use a Punnett square to show all possible genotypes and phenotypes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Analyze how chromosomes carry genetic information.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Connect chromosome behavior in meiosis to Mendel's laws.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}